+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由此形成的性格并非单纯强硬，也不是被动柔弱，而是外在判断清楚、反应迅速，内里却需要稳定基础才能长期维持高质量输出。",
+              "start": 326,
+              "end": 383,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "庚金虽有申中同根，天干又见多个庚金比肩，显示自我标准、独立判断与同类支持并不缺席，但子月本属泄气环境，伤官及水局提高了输出强度，日主需要不断把自身力量转化为观察、判断、表达和实际成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 269,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The Shen–Zi–Chen Three Harmony Water configuration is established, giving unusual structural prominence to expression, production, circulation, and the conversion of thought into results.",
+              "start": 102,
+              "end": 289,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "In ordinary life, this may appear as an ability to isolate the key issue quickly, reorganize complicated material into a coherent proposal, or translate abstract knowledge into a product, method, explanation, or decision framework that others can apply.",
+              "start": 2271,
+              "end": 2524,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It is a layered structure in which output is concentrated, underlying support remains present, and part of the system is continually being adjusted.",
+              "start": 600,
+              "end": 748,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S02",
+        "diagramId": "D06",
+        "pageNumber": 12,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "核心性格与能力",
+          "en": "Core Character and Capability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S02",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 13,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "核心性格与能力",
+          "en": "Core Character and Capability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "日主旺衰定为中和偏弱。",
+              "start": 166,
+              "end": 177,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中，这类能力常表现为快速抓住问题关键，把复杂材料重新组织成清晰方案，或把抽象知识转译成别人能够采用的产品、方法、说明与判断依据。",
+              "start": 532,
+              "end": 598,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里所说的是结构倾向，并不等于必然具有某一种职业、学历或既定成就。",
+              "start": 598,
+              "end": 631,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，这一结构最成熟的状态，不是无限提高反应速度，而是在清晰判断、充分承载与现实转化之间建立节奏。",
+              "start": 1512,
+              "end": 1561,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "This is not, however, a case of complete elemental transformation.",
+              "start": 290,
+              "end": 356,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The original hidden stems and structural meanings of Shen and Chen remain active, while the Yin–Shen clash continues to modify members of the Water configuration.",
+              "start": 357,
+              "end": 519,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The chart therefore should not be reduced to an undifferentiated mass of Water.",
+              "start": 520,
+              "end": 599,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The Day Master is assessed as balanced but leaning weak.",
+              "start": 750,
+              "end": 806,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The natural impulse is to distinguish, correct, and move matters forward.",
+              "start": 2926,
+              "end": 2999,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Fire in appropriate measure can represent warmth, activation, clear expectations, and a workable pace, preventing analysis from becoming too cool or detached.",
+              "start": 5991,
+              "end": 6149,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S02",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 14,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "核心性格与能力",
+          "en": "Core Character and Capability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "因此，命局不能只按一片水势理解，而应看作输出力量集中、内在支撑仍在、局部又持续受到牵动的复合结构。",
+              "start": 115,
+              "end": 164,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "面对含混、低效或逻辑不一致的情况，往往较难仅以表面和谐掩盖问题，而更愿意直接辨别、修正和推进。",
+              "start": 662,
+              "end": 709,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若合作关系具有清楚分工和相互尊重，个人判断与群体资源能够彼此增强。",
+              "start": 778,
+              "end": 811,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "寅申冲与三合水局同时存在，为能力表现加入了一层重要的动态性。",
+              "start": 874,
+              "end": 904,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "一方面，思路能够围绕问题迅速汇集，形成连续的分析与输出；另一方面，内部并不会完全停留在单一轨道上，而是容易出现重新校正、转换角度或推翻原方案的力量。",
+              "start": 904,
+              "end": 978,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一命局真正需要保护的，不是表达能力本身，而是表达背后的承载能力。",
+              "start": 1126,
+              "end": 1159,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Considerable personal energy is therefore directed into observing, evaluating, explaining, and producing tangible results.",
+              "start": 1110,
+              "end": 1232,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The resulting character is neither simply forceful nor passive: judgment can be clear and reactions quick, while sustained high-quality performance still depends on a stable internal and practical foundation.",
+              "start": 1490,
+              "end": 1698,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its central capability lies not merely in possessing knowledge, but in turning understanding into something usable, exchangeable, and measurable.",
+              "start": 1796,
+              "end": 1941,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Companion energy does not mean competition alone; it also shows that capacity can be increased through colleagues, professional equals, and genuinely shared responsibility.",
+              "start": 3100,
+              "end": 3272,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Output can then move faster than assimilation and recovery.",
+              "start": 4388,
+              "end": 4447,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its first meaning here is the coexistence of movement and structural correction.",
+              "start": 4565,
+              "end": 4645,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "pageNumber": 15,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-03-LIFE-STRUCTURE.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "人生结构的主要运行方式，是先接收与分辨信息，再形成表达和方案，继而把输出导向资源、成果或现实安排。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 49,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其长处是学习与应用之间距离较短，能够一边处理材料，一边辨认其中可被改善、交换或落实的部分；但整个人生节奏也容易被“持续产生结果”的要求牵引。",
+              "start": 102,
+              "end": 172,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "真正决定运行质量的，不只是机会多少，而是每一轮输出之后是否有足够空间完成吸收、整理和恢复。",
+              "start": 172,
+              "end": 217,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "This sequence can begin quickly.",
+              "start": 214,
+              "end": 246,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The advantage is a short distance between learning and application.",
+              "start": 447,
+              "end": 514,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The main operating sequence of this life structure is to receive and distinguish information, formulate an explanation or solution, and then direct that output toward resources, results, or practical arrangements.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 213,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "diagramId": "D07",
+        "pageNumber": 16,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 17,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这个链条能够快速启动，因此面对新问题时，往往不是等待条件完全成熟后才行动，而是在理解过程中便开始组织答案。",
+              "start": 49,
+              "end": 102,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一结构天然重视有效性。",
+              "start": 219,
+              "end": 231,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "责任承担也遵循同样的逻辑。",
+              "start": 459,
+              "end": 472,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "清楚、有边界并且可以完成闭环的责任，能够调动判断力与执行力；含混、不断扩张又缺乏资源对应的责任，则会使结构中的泄耗被持续放大。",
+              "start": 472,
+              "end": 535,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于比肩支持明显，承担并不必然要以单独完成为前提。",
+              "start": 535,
+              "end": 560,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰的汇聚与寅申冲的修正同时存在，使人生运行带有“成形—校正—再成形”的特点。",
+              "start": 682,
+              "end": 722,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "财星也使现实安排和承诺具有重要分量。",
+              "start": 1181,
+              "end": 1199,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Faced with a new problem, the tendency is not necessarily to wait until every condition is settled before responding; the answer may already be taking shape while the issue is still being understood.",
+              "start": 247,
+              "end": 446,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Material can be processed while its improvable, exchangeable, or implementable features are being identified.",
+              "start": 515,
+              "end": 624,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Yet the overall rhythm can also become governed by a continuing demand to produce results.",
+              "start": 625,
+              "end": 715,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Effectiveness carries particular weight.",
+              "start": 904,
+              "end": 944,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Outsiders may notice the speed of the result and underestimate the preparation beneath it.",
+              "start": 1435,
+              "end": 1525,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Responsibility follows the same principle.",
+              "start": 1705,
+              "end": 1747,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its effect depends on whether the Earth and Metal foundation can carry it.",
+              "start": 6132,
+              "end": 6206,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 18,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "现实中更有效的方式，往往是由各自具备能力的人共同负责，并明确谁作判断、谁提供资源、谁完成交付。",
+              "start": 560,
+              "end": 607,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "表面上事情已经安排妥当，实际上承载压力仍未真正分散。",
+              "start": 654,
+              "end": 680,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "计划能够围绕目标聚拢，但很少因为初步成形便完全停止变化。",
+              "start": 722,
+              "end": 750,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "顺畅时，这是一种适应复杂环境的能力：既能保持主线，又允许证据改变做法。",
+              "start": 750,
+              "end": 785,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "失衡时，则可能在方案尚未得到充分执行前便持续优化，或者因同时看见多个可行方向而分散投入。",
+              "start": 785,
+              "end": 829,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "问题不一定是缺少决定，而可能是每一个决定都迅速引出下一层需要处理的细节。",
+              "start": 829,
+              "end": 865,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "相反，若安排只停留在口头期待，或条件持续变化而没有重新确认边界，输出会被反复调用，最终形成隐性负担。",
+              "start": 1245,
+              "end": 1295,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Knowledge that has not entered practice can feel incomplete, while expression that does not improve a decision, advance a process, or produce a usable delivery may seem insufficient.",
+              "start": 945,
+              "end": 1127,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "If that hidden layer is also neglected internally, taking on more volume may be mistaken for developing greater ability, when it may actually reduce stability in the next cycle.",
+              "start": 1526,
+              "end": 1703,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "A defined obligation with clear limits and a genuine point of completion can mobilize judgment and execution.",
+              "start": 1748,
+              "end": 1857,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The arrangement may look complete from the outside even though the carrying burden has not truly been distributed.",
+              "start": 2380,
+              "end": 2494,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The difficulty is not necessarily an inability to decide.",
+              "start": 3128,
+              "end": 3185,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Smooth functioning does not mean answering every request immediately.",
+              "start": 4927,
+              "end": 4996,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its central requirement is that every expansion be matched by adequate support.",
+              "start": 6482,
+              "end": 6561,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 7
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "pageNumber": 19,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-04-CAREER.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "适合发挥的职业环境通常需要一定复杂度：材料并非完全标准化，问题需要判断，成果又必须能够被他人使用或转化为实际决定。",
+              "start": 58,
+              "end": 115,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业发展的核心，不在于选择一个固定行业名称，而在于工作是否允许“辨认问题—形成表达—创造现实价值”这一链条完整运作。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 58,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若从事经营、自由职业或管理工作，则需要特别注意：能够提出方向和取得项目，并不等于后续承载会自动形成，后台流程、资源配置和交付能力必须与前端机会同步。",
+              "start": 588,
+              "end": 662,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The most suitable environments generally contain a meaningful degree of complexity.",
+              "start": 216,
+              "end": 299,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Career development is less about selecting one predetermined industry than about finding work in which the sequence of identifying a problem, formulating a response, and creating practical value can operate in full.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 215,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "In a commercial setting, it may involve identifying demand, designing delivery, or improving resource allocation.",
+              "start": 1155,
+              "end": 1268,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "diagramId": "D08",
+        "pageNumber": 20,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 21,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "因此，职业能力较容易集中在分析、策划、研究、产品、技术转译、咨询、流程改进、商业判断、内容与知识应用等功能上。",
+              "start": 194,
+              "end": 249,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里列举的是工作功能而不是命定职业。",
+              "start": 249,
+              "end": 267,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "庚金的标准意识与比肩结构，使职业上较重视专业判断、工作边界和成果质量。",
+              "start": 421,
+              "end": 456,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "完全依赖模糊权威、却不允许提出依据和改进意见的环境，可能较难长期发挥；相较之下，目标清楚、责任可讨论、专业意见能够进入决策的组织，更能容纳这一结构。",
+              "start": 456,
+              "end": 530,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "自主性并不等于必须独立创业。",
+              "start": 530,
+              "end": 544,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "收入结构同样需要区分创造能力与保留能力。",
+              "start": 1100,
+              "end": 1120,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The material is not entirely standardized, judgment is required, and the final result must be usable by someone else or capable of informing a real decision.",
+              "start": 300,
+              "end": 457,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "At the opposite extreme, unrestricted expression without a delivery standard allows the process to stop at opinion rather than becoming durable professional value.",
+              "start": 583,
+              "end": 746,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Relevant career capacity may therefore gather around functions such as analysis, planning, research, product development, technical translation, consulting, process improvement, commercial judgment, and the applied use of content or knowledge.",
+              "start": 748,
+              "end": 991,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It is not limited to speaking or writing.",
+              "start": 2824,
+              "end": 2865,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The hidden Resource function is critical here.",
+              "start": 3175,
+              "end": 3221,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Job title by itself is not a measure of career quality.",
+              "start": 5902,
+              "end": 5957,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 22,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "它也可以表现为在组织内拥有清楚的专业领域，能够对方法和质量负责，并与能力相当的同事协作。",
+              "start": 544,
+              "end": 588,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它不只适合“说”，也适合通过分析、设计、技术、系统或方法让事情变得更有效。",
+              "start": 701,
+              "end": 738,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "真正成熟的职业竞争力，往往不是一次性的聪明反应，而是把成功经验整理成可复制的流程，使个人判断逐步变为稳定能力。",
+              "start": 738,
+              "end": 793,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若长期只追逐即时交付，职业表现可能仍然活跃，但能力更新会逐渐落后于任务增长。",
+              "start": 847,
+              "end": 885,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业压力较大时，结构最容易出现的失真，是前端输出持续增加，后端承载却没有同步扩充。",
+              "start": 887,
+              "end": 928,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "任何一种五行出现，都不能脱离全局而直接等同于升迁、财富或某项确定事件。",
+              "start": 1741,
+              "end": 1776,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 7
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "These are functional examples, not destined occupations.",
+              "start": 992,
+              "end": 1048,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "In a technical setting, the pattern may appear as turning specialized detail into an executable solution.",
+              "start": 1049,
+              "end": 1154,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Whether any of these becomes an actual profession depends on education, experience, opportunity, and environment.",
+              "start": 1447,
+              "end": 1560,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "An environment that relies on vague authority while refusing evidence or constructive improvement may be difficult to inhabit over the long term.",
+              "start": 1800,
+              "end": 1945,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Autonomy does not mean that self-employment is required.",
+              "start": 2116,
+              "end": 2172,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Back-end process, resource allocation, and delivery capability must grow alongside front-end opportunity.",
+              "start": 2575,
+              "end": 2680,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Analysis, design, technology, systems, and methods can all make an operation more effective.",
+              "start": 2866,
+              "end": 2958,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "A more specific career timeline requires actual Luck Pillar and annual data, which have not been provided.",
+              "start": 6123,
+              "end": 6229,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 7
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "pageNumber": 23,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-05-WEALTH.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "结构真正要求的不是压低输出，而是让每一次输出都由足够的流程、储备和执行能力接住。",
+              "start": 403,
+              "end": 443,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水的结构显著度使知识、技术、判断、表达与解决问题的能力容易向外流动，再由木财承接为项目、交易、客户需求、可交付成果或具体责任。",
+              "start": 45,
+              "end": 108,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "资源与财富的重点，不在于把财星简单理解为钱财多寡，而在于既有的伤官生财路径能否被稳定承载。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 45,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The prominence of Water gives knowledge, technique, judgment, communication, and problem-solving an outward-moving quality; Wood then receives that output as projects, transactions, client requirements, deliverables, or practical obligations.",
+              "start": 242,
+              "end": 484,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Income formation and wealth retention must be distinguished.",
+              "start": 915,
+              "end": 975,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Resources and wealth in this chart are not adequately described by counting Wealth stars or treating their presence as a promise of money.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 138,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "diagramId": "D09",
+        "pageNumber": 24,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 25,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这一区分尤其重要：收入形成与财富保留并不是同一件事。",
+              "start": 225,
+              "end": 251,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它可以表现为依靠自身判断推进，也可以表现为与伙伴、同业或团队共同调动资源。",
+              "start": 471,
+              "end": 508,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土印是这一财富结构中更关键的承载条件。",
+              "start": 675,
+              "end": 694,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土为首要用神、金为辅助，所强调的正是先稳住主体与执行基础，再让输出和财星继续流通。",
+              "start": 874,
+              "end": 915,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "较顺畅的状态则是将价值主张、价格条件、交付范围与后续责任放在同一套安排中，使所得与所担相称，让完成一项安排本身成为财富保留的一部分。",
+              "start": 1102,
+              "end": 1168,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火若在具体时序中出现，仍须观察它是否有助于整体运行，而非仅凭季节便作吉凶判断。",
+              "start": 1235,
+              "end": 1274,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "This establishes a channel through which value may be monetized, but it does not determine the amount earned or guarantee that what is generated will be retained.",
+              "start": 751,
+              "end": 913,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The structural requirement is not to suppress productive output, but to ensure that each outward commitment is backed by sufficient process, reserves, and execution.",
+              "start": 1522,
+              "end": 1687,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It can support self-directed action, but it can also work through partners, colleagues, or teams that pool capabilities.",
+              "start": 1798,
+              "end": 1918,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 26,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "月干偏财明透，地支又见正财与偏财暗藏，说明财富议题既有公开可见、需要主动把握的一面，也有嵌在长期安排、细节义务与持续经营之中的一面。",
+              "start": 108,
+              "end": 174,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这些都不是必然事件，而是结构在负荷超过承载时的常见方向。",
+              "start": 1074,
+              "end": 1102,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "同样，水木增强的阶段可能提高表达、交易与资源流动的显著度，同时也会增加交付压力；土金较能发挥作用的阶段，则较有利于整理结构、补充能力与巩固留存。",
+              "start": 1274,
+              "end": 1346,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于没有提供大运、流年的具体排布，不能指定何时发生这些变化，更不能据此断定某年得财或失财。",
+              "start": 1346,
+              "end": 1391,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "能够成立的结论，是不同阶段会改变财富链条中“创造机会”与“承接成果”的相对重点，而最终质量仍取决于二者是否同步。",
+              "start": 1391,
+              "end": 1447,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "When roles are explicit, shared effort, review, and division of labor can increase carrying capacity.",
+              "start": 1919,
+              "end": 2020,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Companion stars do not automatically signify competition or financial loss.",
+              "start": 2179,
+              "end": 2254,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Their result depends on whether cooperation is governed well enough to protect the productive pathway from overload.",
+              "start": 2255,
+              "end": 2371,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Earth Resource is the more important condition behind sustainable wealth.",
+              "start": 2373,
+              "end": 2446,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Because this backing is less visible, it can be easy to focus on front-end opportunities while underestimating the infrastructure needed to complete them.",
+              "start": 2726,
+              "end": 2880,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Under pressure, the characteristic distortion is to answer a carrying problem with still more proposals, explanation, activity, or commitment.",
+              "start": 3104,
+              "end": 3246,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "No luck-pillar or annual sequence has been supplied, so no age, year, gain, or loss can be assigned.",
+              "start": 4566,
+              "end": 4666,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "pageNumber": 27,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-06-RELATIONSHIP.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这里更可靠的阅读，是观察一个人如何把表达、选择与现实责任连接起来。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏财明透而正财暗藏，意味着互动既可能需要灵活回应当下情境，也需要照顾长期承诺、细节秩序与可持续性。",
+              "start": 130,
+              "end": 179,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "日主的承载条件使亲密关系中的“付出”需要特别注意边界。",
+              "start": 649,
+              "end": 676,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "A more reliable interpretation concerns how expression and personal choice are connected with practical responsibility.",
+              "start": 149,
+              "end": 268,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Hurting Officer contributes discernment, articulation, and a wish to correct what is not working.",
+              "start": 845,
+              "end": 942,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The existing output-to-wealth pathway tends to validate a bond through problem-solving, workable arrangements, and the investment of time or resources, rather than leaving the relationship entirely at the level of feeling or intention.",
+              "start": 269,
+              "end": 504,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "diagramId": "D10",
+        "pageNumber": 28,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 29,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "关系是否顺畅，往往不只取决于心意是否存在，还取决于说出的内容能否转化为双方都能承受的安排。",
+              "start": 179,
+              "end": 224,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "二者结合时，较自然的关系方式是保留各自判断，同时通过坦白沟通建立合作。",
+              "start": 270,
+              "end": 305,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "顺畅表达可以是直接说明需要、讨论现实限制、共同改进生活安排；它并不要求任何一方放弃独立性。",
+              "start": 305,
+              "end": 350,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "反过来，如果表达只剩评判、解释或效率要求，关系便可能听见结论，却感受不到承接过程。",
+              "start": 393,
+              "end": 434,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩较多也使平等成为重要议题。",
+              "start": 871,
+              "end": 886,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这种明确并非削弱亲密，反而能让承诺具有可依赖性。",
+              "start": 1012,
+              "end": 1036,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土印与金比劫构成较重要的制衡。",
+              "start": 1078,
+              "end": 1093,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "具体时序会改变关系中哪一层更突出。",
+              "start": 1242,
+              "end": 1259,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Relational ease therefore depends not only on whether care is present, but on whether what is expressed can become an arrangement that both people can carry.",
+              "start": 686,
+              "end": 843,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The repeated Companion influence places autonomy, equality, and independent judgment alongside it.",
+              "start": 943,
+              "end": 1041,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Their constructive combination favors candid cooperation: each person can retain a point of view while discussing needs, constraints, and possible improvements openly.",
+              "start": 1042,
+              "end": 1209,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Under strain, however, communication may become dominated by conclusions, critique, explanation, or efficiency.",
+              "start": 1357,
+              "end": 1468,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Such precision does not reduce intimacy; it makes commitment dependable.",
+              "start": 3566,
+              "end": 3638,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Metal helps maintain a clear standpoint and executable boundaries.",
+              "start": 3915,
+              "end": 3981,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 30,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "关系与亲密模式中，财星不能被机械地等同于某一位配偶，也不能由其位置直接推断婚姻事实。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 42,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰三合水局与寅申冲同时存在，为关系结构增添了一个重要层次：一方面有把经验、信息与共同目标组织起来的能力，另一方面，系统内部仍保留修正、拉动与不同节奏。",
+              "start": 436,
+              "end": 513,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时，隐藏负荷未必立即显现，可能先表现为持续协调、反复说明或试图独自把事情处理妥当。",
+              "start": 726,
+              "end": 768,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "平等运作良好时，双方各自有判断，又愿意共享信息、分担任务并接受复核；运作失衡时，则可能出现每个人都坚持自己的处理方式，或者表面共同承担，实际责任却无人完整承接。",
+              "start": 886,
+              "end": 966,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The content may be accurate, yet the other person may experience little room for the process by which understanding is reached.",
+              "start": 1469,
+              "end": 1596,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The coexistence of the Water Three Harmony and the Yin–Shen clash adds an important qualification.",
+              "start": 1598,
+              "end": 1696,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "There is capacity to organize information, experience, and shared aims into a larger continuity, while an internal source of adjustment and divergent rhythm remains active.",
+              "start": 1697,
+              "end": 1869,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The clash does not cancel the harmony, and the harmony does not erase the clash.",
+              "start": 1870,
+              "end": 1950,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It would therefore be unsound to translate this configuration directly into quarrels, separation, relocation, or any other event.",
+              "start": 1951,
+              "end": 2080,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "This does not prove that either party will overgive.",
+              "start": 2827,
+              "end": 2879,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Earth Resource and Metal Companion provide the main balancing conditions.",
+              "start": 3746,
+              "end": 3819,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "pageNumber": 31,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-07-HEALTH.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "前者容易被看见为“有人一起做”，后者则常在事情能够持续运转时才显出价值。",
+              "start": 176,
+              "end": 212,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其优势是遇到压力时可以调动同层力量，不必把所有责任集中在单一权威或单一照顾者身上；其风险则是，当大家都以为别人也能处理时，责任可能被分散，或者每个人都在付出，却缺乏统一的完成标准。",
+              "start": 636,
+              "end": 726,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "较稳妥的重点，是区分支持从哪里进入结构，以及它以何种方式被感受到。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The other is quieter and infrastructural, taking the form of knowledge, precedent, rules, logistics, and continuity.",
+              "start": 598,
+              "end": 714,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "One is visible and lateral, operating through shared effort, practical cooperation, and people working alongside one another.",
+              "start": 472,
+              "end": 597,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The sounder question is how support enters the structure and in what form it becomes usable.",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 269,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "diagramId": "D11",
+        "pageNumber": 32,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 33,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "若只承认显性的行动帮助，便容易忽视那些不醒目却决定长期稳定性的条件。",
+              "start": 376,
+              "end": 410,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者并存，意味着整体网络可以成立，却不要求其中每个部分始终同向。",
+              "start": 458,
+              "end": 490,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这不等于家庭冲突已经发生，也不表示任何成员必然远离。",
+              "start": 559,
+              "end": 585,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它只是提醒，系统的完整性来自协调差异，而不是假设差异不存在。",
+              "start": 585,
+              "end": 615,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩较强的支持方式重视平等与互相承担。",
+              "start": 617,
+              "end": 636,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "否则，表面上资源很多，实际协调本身也会成为新的任务。",
+              "start": 755,
+              "end": 781,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "如果这些工作长期没有被识别，承担者便可能在外部看来仍然稳定，内部却逐渐失去余量。",
+              "start": 896,
+              "end": 936,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "金的辅助则使个人边界、职责和决策位置更清晰。",
+              "start": 1099,
+              "end": 1121,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The first is easy to recognize as someone helping with a task; the second often becomes apparent only because the whole arrangement continues to function.",
+              "start": 715,
+              "end": 869,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "This does not establish how much help an actual family has provided.",
+              "start": 871,
+              "end": 939,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It shows instead that carrying capacity is structurally distributed rather than derived from one source.",
+              "start": 940,
+              "end": 1044,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It can reside in a reusable method, reliable information, retained experience, material reserves, or permission to pause and review.",
+              "start": 1252,
+              "end": 1384,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Some channels may be suited to continuity, while others introduce a different method, pace, or priority.",
+              "start": 1927,
+              "end": 2031,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "A Companion-based support style values equality and shared responsibility.",
+              "start": 2206,
+              "end": 2280,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 34,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "偏印多藏，使隐藏负荷成为另一个重要主题。",
+              "start": 826,
+              "end": 846,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "更完整的状态，是让负责执行的人也获得资源、时间和替补，而不是只在结果出现后才承认其投入。",
+              "start": 1002,
+              "end": 1046,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水木所带来的沟通、流动与现实需求仍可继续展开，但不至于把整个系统推向只有输出、没有补给的状态。",
+              "start": 1182,
+              "end": 1229,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因而不能指定某年获得援助、离家、组成家庭或发生亲属变化。",
+              "start": 1372,
+              "end": 1400,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Support therefore has two distinct modes.",
+              "start": 430,
+              "end": 471,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "This does not prove family conflict, distance, or separation.",
+              "start": 2032,
+              "end": 2093,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It indicates that cohesion depends on coordinating differences rather than assuming that no differences exist.",
+              "start": 2094,
+              "end": 2204,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its strength is that pressure need not be placed entirely on one authority figure or caretaker; peer-level capacity can be mobilized when demands rise.",
+              "start": 2281,
+              "end": 2432,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Its weakness appears when everyone assumes that someone else can handle the matter, or when many people contribute without a common definition of completion.",
+              "start": 2433,
+              "end": 2590,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The aim is not to make one person carry more, but to ensure that help reaches a specific need and that all parties know when the responsibility has actually been fulfilled.",
+              "start": 2779,
+              "end": 2951,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Metal adds clearer personal boundaries, responsibility, and decision authority.",
+              "start": 3958,
+              "end": 4037,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "pageNumber": 35,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-08-TIMING.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 219,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中可能呈现为同时处理过多开放事项，频繁切换关注点，或者为了维持推进而过早承诺下一阶段。",
+              "start": 639,
+              "end": 684,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一命局的压力并不只来自外部任务的多少，更来自输出、落实与承载之间是否保持比例。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 40,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 87,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The structure therefore has access to learning, synthesis, accumulated experience, and framework-building, but those functions require protected time and space.",
+              "start": 2833,
+              "end": 2993,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It lies in whether expression, practical delivery, and structural support remain proportionate.",
+              "start": 88,
+              "end": 183,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "diagramId": "D12",
+        "pageNumber": 36,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 37,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰水局提高了输出系统的显著度，使思考、表达与流动效率更容易成为结构中的前台功能；寅申冲同时保留内部修正力，意味着推进并非单线展开，而常伴随方向校正、条件变化或不同要求之间的牵动。",
+              "start": 219,
+              "end": 310,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它描述的是一种动态状态：一方面需要连贯推进，另一方面又必须不断回应局部变化。",
+              "start": 353,
+              "end": 391,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "当承载充足时，这种动态可以形成敏锐、灵活而有结果意识的工作方式。",
+              "start": 393,
+              "end": 425,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "压力上升后，失真往往出现在“前端很强、后端不足”。",
+              "start": 571,
+              "end": 596,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "隐藏的负荷尤其值得重视。",
+              "start": 765,
+              "end": 777,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏印多藏于地支，说明支持条件虽存在，却未必总是直接显露在表层。",
+              "start": 777,
+              "end": 808,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The established pathway naturally carries ideas toward articulation, problem-solving, tangible output, and real-world application.",
+              "start": 184,
+              "end": 314,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "When functioning smoothly, this structure can identify problems, organize complex information, and convert thought into usable outcomes.",
+              "start": 720,
+              "end": 856,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The Water configuration gives the output system considerable prominence, while the simultaneous Yin–Shen clash preserves an internal force of adjustment.",
+              "start": 857,
+              "end": 1010,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "These are not fixed behavioral predictions.",
+              "start": 2505,
+              "end": 2548,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Hidden load is particularly important here.",
+              "start": 2681,
+              "end": 2724,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "More Fire is not automatically better.",
+              "start": 3541,
+              "end": 3579,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 38,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "伤官生财的路径会自然推动思路向表达、解决问题、创造结果与现实兑现延伸；但在日主处于中和偏弱一侧时，每一次继续增加输出、责任或资源调度，都会同步消耗自身的稳定度。",
+              "start": 40,
+              "end": 120,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "三合与冲并存，不能简单解释为一种力量胜过另一种力量，更不能直接对应某项已经发生的冲突。",
+              "start": 310,
+              "end": 353,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时，表达不是为了即时释放压力，而是能够服务于完成；资源不是只被启动，还能被保留、整理和继续使用。",
+              "start": 480,
+              "end": 529,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它们共同的根源，是输出与现实兑现持续扩张，而支持系统没有同步增加。",
+              "start": 730,
+              "end": 763,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由此形成的脆弱点，不是缺乏能力，而是能力长期被用于交付，却少有机会回补自身。",
+              "start": 899,
+              "end": 937,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Progress is therefore not necessarily linear: continuity may coexist with changing conditions, competing requirements, or repeated course correction.",
+              "start": 1011,
+              "end": 1160,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Neither the combination nor the clash cancels the other, and their coexistence should not be translated into a predetermined conflict or event.",
+              "start": 1161,
+              "end": 1304,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It describes a dynamic operating environment in which sustained flow and local correction are both necessary.",
+              "start": 1305,
+              "end": 1414,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "With adequate carrying capacity, this can become an alert, flexible, and result-conscious mode of functioning.",
+              "start": 1416,
+              "end": 1526,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Metal provides secondary reinforcement through steadiness, boundaries, and the ability to continue.",
+              "start": 1646,
+              "end": 1745,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It must not, however, be silently merged with the Earth-and-Metal support logic.",
+              "start": 3460,
+              "end": 3540,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "That is what allows the chart’s productive pathway not only to begin, but also to remain sustainable.",
+              "start": 4025,
+              "end": 4126,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "pageNumber": 39,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-09-GUIDANCE.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 57,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者的意义并不是让结构停下来，而是让原本活跃的输出具有保存、复核和延续的条件。",
+              "start": 267,
+              "end": 306,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "从长期功能看，土的阶段性加强较有利于建立承载层，使经验、知识和已经展开的事务能够形成制度、程序与可持续的基础。",
+              "start": 188,
+              "end": 243,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 71,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Without it, the same activity can multiply open commitments, coordination costs, and maintenance duties.",
+              "start": 1797,
+              "end": 1901,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Metal offers a different but related form of support through continuity, boundaries, and a firmer center of execution.",
+              "start": 867,
+              "end": 985,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "diagramId": "D13",
+        "pageNumber": 40,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 41,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。",
+              "start": 243,
+              "end": 267,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。",
+              "start": 306,
+              "end": 367,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。",
+              "start": 367,
+              "end": 401,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。",
+              "start": 534,
+              "end": 585,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "They alter which functions become easier to access, which ones move to the foreground, and where the greater burden must be carried.",
+              "start": 72,
+              "end": 204,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The essential question is whether the added influence completes the existing process or pushes production and practical commitment beyond what the structure can sustain consistently.",
+              "start": 515,
+              "end": 697,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Periods that strengthen Earth can improve containment, allowing experience, knowledge, and ongoing matters to settle into systems, procedures, and durable foundations.",
+              "start": 699,
+              "end": 866,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Their purpose is not to stop movement.",
+              "start": 986,
+              "end": 1024,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "With adequate support, increased activity can become learning, solutions, and workable arrangements.",
+              "start": 1696,
+              "end": 1796,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Fire must be treated as a separate timing layer.",
+              "start": 2059,
+              "end": 2107,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 42,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。",
+              "start": 57,
+              "end": 93,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。",
+              "start": 403,
+              "end": 467,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。",
+              "start": 587,
+              "end": 604,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。",
+              "start": 727,
+              "end": 763,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。",
+              "start": 765,
+              "end": 792,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。",
+              "start": 844,
+              "end": 885,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。",
+              "start": 1086,
+              "end": 1129,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The natal pathway remains the foundation; luck pillars and annual influences change its emphasis, pace, and support conditions.",
+              "start": 205,
+              "end": 332,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It is to give active output the means to be preserved, reviewed, and extended.",
+              "start": 1025,
+              "end": 1103,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Which area of life carries that change cannot be specified without corresponding real-world information.",
+              "start": 1362,
+              "end": 1466,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "A cycle that further emphasizes movement, expression, expanded objectives, or practical realization may make the established productive pathway more visible.",
+              "start": 1468,
+              "end": 1625,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Easier activation, however, is not the same as unconditional benefit.",
+              "start": 1626,
+              "end": 1695,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "When Fire operates alongside stable containment, action may become more focused and momentum clearer.",
+              "start": 2322,
+              "end": 2423,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "pageNumber": 43,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-10-APPENDIX.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
+              "start": 182,
+              "end": 223,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。",
+              "start": 401,
+              "end": 429,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。",
+              "start": 83,
+              "end": 140,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.",
+              "start": 85,
+              "end": 242,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.",
+              "start": 488,
+              "end": 560,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The central feature is not the arrival of one isolated influence, but the simultaneous activation of support, seasonal warming, and several branch relationships.",
+              "start": 326,
+              "end": 487,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "diagramId": "D14",
+        "pageNumber": 44,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 45,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "当前所给时序为己巳大运、丙寅流年，但其公历年份、年龄与起止日期均未提供，因此只能讨论这一组干支如何作用于原局，不能把它安放到确定的人生时间点，也不能据此断言具体事件。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 83,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。",
+              "start": 223,
+              "end": 249,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。",
+              "start": 249,
+              "end": 291,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。",
+              "start": 429,
+              "end": 461,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。",
+              "start": 542,
+              "end": 559,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The supplied current timing is a Ji-Si luck pillar with a Bing-Yin annual influence.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 84,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Ji Earth at the luck-pillar stem corresponds in principle with the chart’s need for containment, but it forms a Jia–Ji combination with the natal month stem.",
+              "start": 562,
+              "end": 719,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Yet its role is not limited to warmth.",
+              "start": 1513,
+              "end": 1551,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The Bing-Yin annual influence further heightens the visibility of Fire and Yin.",
+              "start": 2100,
+              "end": 2179,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Annual Yin repeats the natal Yin, clashes with natal Shen, harms the luck-pillar Si, and reinforces the Yin–Si–Shen network.",
+              "start": 2180,
+              "end": 2304,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Fire may warm and activate, but it cannot replace Earth-and-Metal support.",
+              "start": 4487,
+              "end": 4561,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 46,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。",
+              "start": 559,
+              "end": 598,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。",
+              "start": 662,
+              "end": 699,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。",
+              "start": 699,
+              "end": 738,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。",
+              "start": 810,
+              "end": 849,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。",
+              "start": 849,
+              "end": 907,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。",
+              "start": 1141,
+              "end": 1166,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于没有公历年份、年龄及事件资料，本节不延伸到具体预测。",
+              "start": 1232,
+              "end": 1260,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "It cannot be assigned to a definite life stage or used to assert a concrete event.",
+              "start": 243,
+              "end": 325,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Combination establishes connection and mutual involvement; it does not by itself establish elemental transformation, and no transformation conclusion has been supplied.",
+              "start": 720,
+              "end": 888,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "A more precise reading is that organization, stabilization, and carrying capacity move to the foreground while becoming intertwined with the chart’s existing route toward practical realization.",
+              "start": 994,
+              "end": 1187,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Si introduces Fire and therefore carries a climate-regulating implication within the cold natal setting.",
+              "start": 1408,
+              "end": 1512,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "As one arrangement moves forward, it may be pulled simultaneously by the natal structure, the long-term cycle, and the annual demand.",
+              "start": 2415,
+              "end": 2548,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "If shared support exists only verbally, hidden overload may still concentrate in one place.",
+              "start": 4144,
+              "end": 4235,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTEGRATED_MAP",
+        "diagramId": "D15",
+        "pageNumber": 47,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "八字整合运行图",
+          "en": "Integrated BaZi Map"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "CLOSING_REALITY_BRIDGE",
+        "pageNumber": 48,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "把解读带回生活",
+          "en": "Bring the Reading into Life"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 219,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 57,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
+              "start": 182,
+              "end": 223,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            {
+              "text": "The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 87,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 71,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.",
+              "start": 85,
+              "end": 242,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      }
