+      {
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S07",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "这种配置并不证明现实家庭一定提供了多少帮助，而是说明命理上的承载往往不是单一来源。",
+                "start": 214,
+                "end": 255,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若只承认显性的行动帮助，便容易忽视那些不醒目却决定长期稳定性的条件。",
+                "start": 376,
+                "end": 410,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "两者并存，意味着整体网络可以成立，却不要求其中每个部分始终同向。",
+                "start": 458,
+                "end": 490,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这不等于家庭冲突已经发生，也不表示任何成员必然远离。",
+                "start": 559,
+                "end": 585,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它只是提醒，系统的完整性来自协调差异，而不是假设差异不存在。",
+                "start": 585,
+                "end": 615,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "比肩较强的支持方式重视平等与互相承担。",
+                "start": 617,
+                "end": 636,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "共享支持只有在分工、权限和回馈机制清楚时，才真正减少负担。",
+                "start": 726,
+                "end": 755,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "否则，表面上资源很多，实际协调本身也会成为新的任务。",
+                "start": 755,
+                "end": 781,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "如果这些工作长期没有被识别，承担者便可能在外部看来仍然稳定，内部却逐渐失去余量。",
+                "start": 896,
+                "end": 936,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "更完整的状态，是让负责执行的人也获得资源、时间和替补，而不是只在结果出现后才承认其投入。",
+                "start": 1002,
+                "end": 1046,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "金的辅助则使个人边界、职责和决策位置更清晰。",
+                "start": 1099,
+                "end": 1121,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "水木所带来的沟通、流动与现实需求仍可继续展开，但不至于把整个系统推向只有输出、没有补给的状态。",
+                "start": 1182,
+                "end": 1229,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "此局的比肩多见于天干并在地支有根，偏印则分布于多个地支而多处于藏干层面，因此支持具有两种不同形态：一类较为可见，来自并肩承担、共同处理和同层协作；另一类较为隐蔽，体现为经验、规则、知识、后勤和稳定基础。",
+                "start": 75,
+                "end": 176,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "可见的比肩支持适合处理即时任务，也能通过分工与互相补位降低个人压力；隐藏的印星支持则更像后台系统，需要时间积累，且未必以直接安慰或公开援助的形式出现。",
+                "start": 255,
+                "end": 330,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "现实中，支持可能存在于一套可沿用的方法、可靠的信息、有人保留的经验，或允许休整和复盘的空间。",
+                "start": 330,
+                "end": 376,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "申子辰形成的整体联系，使支持系统具有组织与串联不同资源的潜力，而寅申冲仍在其中保留调整力量。",
+                "start": 412,
+                "end": 458,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "放在家庭和支持议题上，可以理解为共同目标与个别差异能够同时存在：某些成员或支持渠道适合稳定维持，另一些则可能带来不同方法、节奏或优先次序。",
+                "start": 490,
+                "end": 559,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里的关键并不是要求某个人承担更多，而是让支持能够抵达具体需要，并且知道何时已经完成。",
+                "start": 781,
+                "end": 824,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "偏印多藏，使隐藏负荷成为另一个重要主题。",
+                "start": 826,
+                "end": 846,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "后台支持往往依靠少数不易被注意的工作维持，例如整理信息、预留资源、处理后续、修正错误或吸收突发变化。",
+                "start": 846,
+                "end": 896,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官生财的运作又会不断把能力引向实际任务，所以家庭或支持网络若持续增加要求，却没有同步补充承载，个人便容易以继续解决问题来回应疲惫。",
+                "start": 936,
+                "end": 1002,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因而不能指定某年获得援助、离家、组成家庭或发生亲属变化。",
+                "start": 1372,
+                "end": 1400,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "前者容易被看见为“有人一起做”，后者则常在事情能够持续运转时才显出价值。",
+              "start": 176,
+              "end": 212,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其优势是遇到压力时可以调动同层力量，不必把所有责任集中在单一权威或单一照顾者身上；其风险则是，当大家都以为别人也能处理时，责任可能被分散，或者每个人都在付出，却缺乏统一的完成标准。",
+              "start": 636,
+              "end": 726,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "较稳妥的重点，是区分支持从哪里进入结构，以及它以何种方式被感受到。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S08",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "伤官生财的路径会自然推动思路向表达、解决问题、创造结果与现实兑现延伸；但在日主处于中和偏弱一侧时，每一次继续增加输出、责任或资源调度，都会同步消耗自身的稳定度。",
+                "start": 40,
+                "end": 120,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "申子辰水局提高了输出系统的显著度，使思考、表达与流动效率更容易成为结构中的前台功能；寅申冲同时保留内部修正力，意味着推进并非单线展开，而常伴随方向校正、条件变化或不同要求之间的牵动。",
+                "start": 219,
+                "end": 310,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它描述的是一种动态状态：一方面需要连贯推进，另一方面又必须不断回应局部变化。",
+                "start": 353,
+                "end": 391,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "当承载充足时，这种动态可以形成敏锐、灵活而有结果意识的工作方式。",
+                "start": 393,
+                "end": 425,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "此时，表达不是为了即时释放压力，而是能够服务于完成；资源不是只被启动，还能被保留、整理和继续使用。",
+                "start": 480,
+                "end": 529,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "压力上升后，失真往往出现在“前端很强、后端不足”。",
+                "start": 571,
+                "end": 596,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它们共同的根源，是输出与现实兑现持续扩张，而支持系统没有同步增加。",
+                "start": 730,
+                "end": 763,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "隐藏的负荷尤其值得重视。",
+                "start": 765,
+                "end": 777,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "偏印多藏于地支，说明支持条件虽存在，却未必总是直接显露在表层。",
+                "start": 777,
+                "end": 808,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "结构可能具有学习、整理、吸收经验与建立框架的能力，但这些能力需要时间和空间才能发挥。",
+                "start": 808,
+                "end": 850,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "由此形成的脆弱点，不是缺乏能力，而是能力长期被用于交付，却少有机会回补自身。",
+                "start": 899,
+                "end": 937,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "因而，真正需要留意的并不是“能不能做”，而是做得越多以后，是否仍有足够的印比承接后续维护、反复修订与长期责任。",
+                "start": 120,
+                "end": 175,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "三合与冲并存，不能简单解释为一种力量胜过另一种力量，更不能直接对应某项已经发生的冲突。",
+                "start": 310,
+                "end": 353,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "土所代表的扶身与承载能够帮助输出沉淀为方法、秩序和可重复的流程，金的比劫支持则有助于维持立场、边界与持续执行。",
+                "start": 425,
+                "end": 480,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "责任分配清楚、协作支持真实存在时，结构中的流动性便较容易转化为效率，而不是消耗。",
+                "start": 529,
+                "end": 569,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "思考和回应仍可快速运作，新的安排也可能持续进入，但恢复、归档、复核和长期维护逐渐落后。",
+                "start": 596,
+                "end": 639,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里不能据命局断定具体行为一定发生；更准确地说，这些是结构在承载不足时较容易出现的风险形态。",
+                "start": 684,
+                "end": 730,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "如果外部只看见即时产出，而没有为准备、复盘和恢复留下位置，原本可以提供支撑的部分便不容易充分介入。",
+                "start": 850,
+                "end": 899,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "火的出现不应被笼统理解为越多越好；如果只有加速和催动，而土金承载没有跟上，反而可能令已经活跃的输出承担更多压力。",
+                "start": 987,
+                "end": 1043,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "相反，当节奏、规则和支持先行建立时，适度的火性条件才更可能发挥温暖与推动作用。",
+                "start": 1043,
+                "end": 1082,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "压力管理的核心因此不是压低表达或回避成果，而是让学习、准备、边界、协作与恢复成为产出机制的一部分，使伤官生财不止能够启动，也能够被长期承受。",
+                "start": 1082,
+                "end": 1152,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 219,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中可能呈现为同时处理过多开放事项，频繁切换关注点，或者为了维持推进而过早承诺下一阶段。",
+              "start": 639,
+              "end": 684,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一命局的压力并不只来自外部任务的多少，更来自输出、落实与承载之间是否保持比例。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 40,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S09",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。",
+                "start": 243,
+                "end": 267,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。",
+                "start": 306,
+                "end": 367,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。",
+                "start": 367,
+                "end": 401,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。",
+                "start": 403,
+                "end": 467,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "如果支持同步存在，活跃度可以转化为学习成果、解决方案和可落实的安排；如果支持不足，同样的活跃度便可能增加开放事项、协作成本和后续维护。",
+                "start": 467,
+                "end": 534,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。",
+                "start": 534,
+                "end": 585,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。",
+                "start": 587,
+                "end": 604,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。",
+                "start": 727,
+                "end": 763,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。",
+                "start": 765,
+                "end": 792,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。",
+                "start": 57,
+                "end": 93,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，判断转折时不能只看某一五行出现，也不能把一段大运直接等同于成功、阻碍或某类固定事件；真正需要观察的是，新增力量究竟补足了原有路径，还是令输出与兑现进一步超过日主所能稳定承受的范围。",
+                "start": 93,
+                "end": 186,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它是冬令背景下的调候候选，可以带来温暖、启动与显化，但不能据此覆盖扶抑与格局层面对土金承载的优先判断。",
+                "start": 604,
+                "end": 655,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "原局中的三合与冲同时存在，所以后续大运、流年再次触及相关成员时，可能提高整合、流动、修正或牵动的显著度。",
+                "start": 792,
+                "end": 844,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。",
+                "start": 844,
+                "end": 885,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "合不必然意味着顺利，冲也不必然意味着损失；它们分别提示连接、重组、位移或修正的可能机制，实际表现仍取决于承载条件以及现实情境。",
+                "start": 885,
+                "end": 948,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "由此看，较可靠的长期判断方式，是把每一阶段放回“输出—兑现—承载”的完整链条中。",
+                "start": 950,
+                "end": 990,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "周期若补足后端，重点可以从不断启动转向沉淀、整合和持续；周期若加强前端，则需要更严格地核对时间、支持和责任容量；周期若同时引动多组关系，转折可能表现为旧安排需要重新协调，而不是简单的吉凶翻转。",
+                "start": 990,
+                "end": 1086,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。",
+                "start": 1086,
+                "end": 1129,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "可以确定的只是：长期变化会改变结构重点，却不会取消原局对承载与制衡的持续要求。",
+                "start": 1129,
+                "end": 1168,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 57,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者的意义并不是让结构停下来，而是让原本活跃的输出具有保存、复核和延续的条件。",
+              "start": 267,
+              "end": 306,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "从长期功能看，土的阶段性加强较有利于建立承载层，使经验、知识和已经展开的事务能够形成制度、程序与可持续的基础。",
+              "start": 188,
+              "end": 243,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "TIMING",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "TIMING",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S10",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "当前所给时序为己巳大运、丙寅流年，但其公历年份、年龄与起止日期均未提供，因此只能讨论这一组干支如何作用于原局，不能把它安放到确定的人生时间点，也不能据此断言具体事件。",
+                "start": 0,
+                "end": 83,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。",
+                "start": 223,
+                "end": 249,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。",
+                "start": 249,
+                "end": 291,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。",
+                "start": 429,
+                "end": 461,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。",
+                "start": 542,
+                "end": 559,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。",
+                "start": 662,
+                "end": 699,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。",
+                "start": 699,
+                "end": 738,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。",
+                "start": 810,
+                "end": 849,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。",
+                "start": 849,
+                "end": 907,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "此时最需要观察的，不是机会数量，而是每一项安排是否有明确负责人、可用资源、完成标准与退出条件。",
+                "start": 1028,
+                "end": 1075,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "大运天干己土进入，表面上与原局所需的承载方向相呼应，但己与原局月干甲形成甲己合。",
+                "start": 142,
+                "end": 182,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "现实层面可能更强调如何把已经启动的事项纳入规则、期限和责任结构，但是否真正减轻负担，仍取决于支持能否落实，而不只是名义上存在。",
+                "start": 291,
+                "end": 354,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "大运地支巳带来火的调候意味，为冬令背景增加温暖与启动条件；然而巳并非只发挥单纯的温暖作用。",
+                "start": 356,
+                "end": 401,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。",
+                "start": 559,
+                "end": 598,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这种重复和多重触发，会使“调整中的调整”成为当期的重要特征：一项安排在推进时，可能同时受到旧结构、当前周期和年度要求的共同牵引。",
+                "start": 598,
+                "end": 662,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "在较顺畅的表现中，己土的承载倾向可以帮助整理流程，巳、丙之火则可能提供温度、可见度与行动动力，使原本活跃的表达与兑现路径更容易形成明确节奏。",
+                "start": 740,
+                "end": 810,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "压力下的失真则可能来自同时把“支持出现”和“承载已经完成”视为同一件事。",
+                "start": 909,
+                "end": 945,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "甲己合使支持与现实目标之间存在牵连，巳与申、寅之间的多重关系又增加协调复杂度；若再因丙寅的推动而持续加快，容易出现前端行动明显增强，而后端整理、确认与恢复不足的局面。",
+                "start": 945,
+                "end": 1028,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "共享支持若只是口头存在，隐藏负荷仍可能集中于个人；相反，若协作能够实际分担维护和复核，这段时序的活跃度才较容易转化为可持续成果。",
+                "start": 1075,
+                "end": 1139,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。",
+                "start": 1141,
+                "end": 1166,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-2",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "由于没有公历年份、年龄及事件资料，本节不延伸到具体预测。",
+                "start": 1232,
+                "end": 1260,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
