+    &quot;end&quot;: 1596,
+    &quot;sourceText&quot;: &quot;Hurting Officer contributes discernment, articulation, and a wish to correct what is not working. The repeated Companion influence places autonomy, equality, and independent judgment alongside it. Their constructive combination favors candid cooperation: each person can retain a point of view while discussing needs, constraints, and possible improvements openly. When differences are treated as information, Hurting Officer can identify the actual issue and the Companion quality can preserve mutual standing. Under strain, however, communication may become dominated by conclusions, critique, explanation, or efficiency. The content may be accurate, yet the other person may experience little room for the process by which understanding is reached.&quot;,
