ng God ·</tspan><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="19">Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="573.9877161664095" y="238.83185604063473" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="0">壬 / 癸</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="wealth"><rect x="394.75168176580644" y="359.66814395936524" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="492.25168176580644" y="381.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">偏财 · 正财</tspan></text><text x="492.25168176580644" y="402.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">Indirect · Direct</tspan><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="19">Wealth</tspan></text><text x="492.25168176580644" y="445.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">甲 / 乙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="pressure"><rect x="130.24831823419356" y="359.66814395936524" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="227.74831823419356" y="381.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">七杀责任</tspan></text><text x="227.74831823419356" y="402.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">Seven Killings</tspan></text><text x="227.74831823419356" y="445.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">丙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="48.51228383359043" y="152.83185604063476" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="146.01228383359043" y="174.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="146.01228383359043" y="195.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">Indirect Resource</tspan></text><text x="146.01228383359043" y="238.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>40 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="41" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="243" data-source-end="267" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。</p><p data-source-start="306" data-source-end="367" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。</p><p data-source-start="367" data-source-end="401" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。</p><p data-source-start="534" data-source-end="585" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="72" data-source-end="204" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">They alter which functions become easier to access, which ones move to the foreground, and where the greater burden must be carried.</p><p data-source-start="515" data-source-end="697" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The essential question is whether the added influence completes the existing process or pushes production and practical commitment beyond what the structure can sustain consistently.</p><p data-source-start="699" data-source-end="866" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Periods that strengthen Earth can improve containment, allowing experience, knowledge, and ongoing matters to settle into systems, procedures, and durable foundations.</p><p data-source-start="986" data-source-end="1024" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Their purpose is not to stop movement.</p><p data-source-start="1696" data-source-end="1796" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">With adequate support, increased activity can become learning, solutions, and workable arrangements.</p><p data-source-start="2059" data-source-end="2107" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Fire must be treated as a separate timing layer.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>41 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="42" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="57" data-source-end="93" data-source-role="TIMING">原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。</p><p data-source-start="403" data-source-end="467" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。</p><p data-source-start="587" data-source-end="604" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。</p><p data-source-start="727" data-source-end="763" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。</p><p data-source-start="765" data-source-end="792" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。</p><p data-source-start="844" data-source-end="885" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。</p><p data-source-start="1086" data-source-end="1129" data-source-role="TIMING">由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="205" data-source-end="332" data-source-role="TIMING">The natal pathway remains the foundation; luck pillars and annual influences change its emphasis, pace, and support conditions.</p><p data-source-start="1025" data-source-end="1103" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It is to give active output the means to be preserved, reviewed, and extended.</p><p data-source-start="1362" data-source-end="1466" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">Which area of life carries that change cannot be specified without corresponding real-world information.</p><p data-source-start="1468" data-source-end="1625" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">A cycle that further emphasizes movement, expression, expanded objectives, or practical realization may make the established productive pathway more visible.</p><p data-source-start="1626" data-source-end="1695" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Easier activation, however, is not the same as unconditional benefit.</p><p data-source-start="2322" data-source-end="2423" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">When Fire operates alongside stable containment, action may become more focused and momentum clearer.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>42 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="43" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-10-APPENDIX.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="182" data-source-end="223" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="85" data-source-end="242" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="401" data-source-end="429" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="488" data-source-end="560" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="83" data-source-end="140" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="326" data-source-end="487" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">The central feature is not the arrival of one isolated influence, but the simultaneous activation of support, seasonal warming, and several branch relationships.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>43 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="44" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D14" data-visual-grammar="TIMING_LAYERS" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 720" role="img" aria-label="当前时序激活"><title>当前时序激活</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D14" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-node-id="natal"><rect x="55" y="5.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="27.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">原局</tspan></text><text x="360" y="48.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Natal</tspan></text><text x="360" y="80.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚申 · 甲子 · 庚辰 · 庚寅</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="dayun"><rect x="55" y="117.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="139.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">当前大运</tspan></text><text x="360" y="160.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Current Da Yun</tspan></text><text x="360" y="192.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">己巳</tspan></text></g><g data-edge-from="natal" data-edge-to="dayun" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 94 L 360 118" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D14)"/></g><g data-node-id="annual"><rect x="55" y="229.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="251.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度层</tspan></text><text x="360" y="272.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Annual layer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="304.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">丙寅</tspan></text></g><g data-edge-from="dayun" data-edge-to="annual" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 206 L 360 230" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D14)"/></g><text x="360" y="365" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">甲己合，不判化土 / Jia–Ji combination; no Earth transformation</tspan></text><text x="360" y="412" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">巳申六合兼破 / Si–Shen combination and break</tspan></text><text x="360" y="459" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">巳寅害 / Si–Yin harm</tspan></text><text x="360" y="506" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">寅巳申刑 / Yin–Si–Shen punishment</tspan></text><text x="360" y="553" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅重复原局寅 / Annual Yin repeats natal Yin</tspan></text><text x="360" y="600" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅冲原局申 / Annual Yin clashes with natal Shen</tspan></text><text x="360" y="647" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅害大运巳 / Annual Yin harms Da Yun Si</tspan></text></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>44 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="45" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="83" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">当前所给时序为己巳大运、丙寅流年，但其公历年份、年龄与起止日期均未提供，因此只能讨论这一组干支如何作用于原局，不能把它安放到确定的人生时间点，也不能据此断言具体事件。</p><p data-source-start="223" data-source-end="249" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。</p><p data-source-start="249" data-source-end="291" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。</p><p data-source-start="429" data-source-end="461" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。</p><p data-source-start="542" data-source-end="559" data-source-role="TIMING">丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="84" data-source-role="TIMING">The supplied current timing is a Ji-Si luck pillar with a Bing-Yin annual influence.</p><p data-source-start="562" data-source-end="719" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Ji Earth at the luck-pillar stem corresponds in principle with the chart’s need for containment, but it forms a Jia–Ji combination with the natal month stem.</p><p data-source-start="1513" data-source-end="1551" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Yet its role is not limited to warmth.</p><p data-source-start="2100" data-source-end="2179" data-source-role="TIMING">The Bing-Yin annual influence further heightens the visibility of Fire and Yin.</p><p data-source-start="2180" data-source-end="2304" data-source-role="TIMING">Annual Yin repeats the natal Yin, clashes with natal Shen, harms the luck-pillar Si, and reinforces the Yin–Si–Shen network.</p><p data-source-start="4487" data-source-end="4561" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">Fire may warm and activate, but it cannot replace Earth-and-Metal support.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>45 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="46" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="559" data-source-end="598" data-source-role="TIMING">年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。</p><p data-source-start="662" data-source-end="699" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。</p><p data-source-start="699" data-source-end="738" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。</p><p data-source-start="810" data-source-end="849" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。</p><p data-source-start="849" data-source-end="907" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。</p><p data-source-start="1141" data-source-end="1166" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。</p><p data-source-start="1232" data-source-end="1260" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">由于没有公历年份、年龄及事件资料，本节不延伸到具体预测。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="243" data-source-end="325" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">It cannot be assigned to a definite life stage or used to assert a concrete event.</p><p data-source-start="720" data-source-end="888" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Combination establishes connection and mutual involvement; it does not by itself establish elemental transformation, and no transformation conclusion has been supplied.</p><p data-source-start="994" data-source-end="1187" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">A more precise reading is that organization, stabilization, and carrying capacity move to the foreground while becoming intertwined with the chart’s existing route toward practical realization.</p><p data-source-start="1408" data-source-end="1512" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Si introduces Fire and therefore carries a climate-regulating implication within the cold natal setting.</p><p data-source-start="2415" data-source-end="2548" data-source-role="TIMING">As one arrangement moves forward, it may be pulled simultaneously by the natal structure, the long-term cycle, and the annual demand.</p><p data-source-start="4144" data-source-end="4235" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">If shared support exists only verbally, hidden overload may still concentrate in one place.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>46 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="47" data-page-role="INTEGRATED_MAP" data-section-id=""><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>八字整合运行图<small lang="en">Integrated BaZi Map</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D15" data-visual-grammar="INTEGRATED_RADIAL" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 540" role="img" aria-label="八字整合运行图"><title>八字整合运行图</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D15" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="peer" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 180 L 360 125" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D15)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="output" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 419.36266477570734 212.90452816411423 L 492.18604842896 167.39751146413906" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D15)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="wealth" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 428.5433615743164 264.20589962278075 L 530.31397691