 x="120" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="120" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="support"><rect x="502.5" y="170" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="600" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="600" dy="0">用神 · 辅助</tspan></text><text x="600" y="213" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="600" dy="0">Primary · Secondary</tspan></text><text x="600" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="600" dy="0">土 / 金</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="output"><rect x="262.5" y="15" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="37" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">食神 · 伤官</tspan></text><text x="360" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Eating God ·</tspan><tspan x="360" dy="19">Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">壬 / 癸</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure><figure data-diagram-id="D05" data-visual-grammar="NATAL_NETWORK" class="bdm-compact-diagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 720 420" role="img" aria-label="原局关系"><title>原局关系</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D05" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="year" data-edge-to="month" data-edge-type="三合"><path d="M 235 75 L 480 75" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D05)"/></g><g data-edge-from="month" data-edge-to="day" data-edge-type="三合"><path d="M 485.65984789873596 102.57435090054173 L 229.34015210126404 212.42564909945827" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D05)"/></g><g data-edge-from="year" data-edge-to="hour" data-edge-type="冲"><path d="M 229.34015210126404 102.57435090054173 L 485.65984789873596 212.42564909945827" class="bdm-edge bdm-edge-clash" marker-end="url(#arrow-D05)"/></g><g data-node-id="year"><rect x="67.5" y="25" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="165" y="47" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="165" dy="0">年柱</tspan></text><text x="165" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="165" dy="0">Year</tspan></text><text x="165" y="111" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="165" dy="0">庚申</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="month"><rect x="452.5" y="25" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="550" y="47" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="550" dy="0">月柱</tspan></text><text x="550" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="550" dy="0">Month</tspan></text><text x="550" y="111" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="550" dy="0">甲子</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="day"><rect x="67.5" y="190" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="165" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="165" dy="0">日柱</tspan></text><text x="165" y="233" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="165" dy="0">Day</tspan></text><text x="165" y="276" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="165" dy="0">庚辰</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="hour"><rect x="452.5" y="190" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="550" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="550" dy="0">时柱</tspan></text><text x="550" y="233" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="550" dy="0">Hour</tspan></text><text x="550" y="276" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="550" dy="0">庚寅</tspan></text></g><text x="357.5" y="63" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="357.5" dy="0">三合 / Combination</tspan></text><text x="272.5" y="128.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="272.5" dy="0">三合 / Combination</tspan></text><text x="442.5" y="162.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="442.5" dy="0">冲 / Clash</tspan></text><text x="360" y="350" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">三合成立，不判完全化水；寅申冲并存 / Combination established without full</tspan><tspan x="360" dy="19">transformation; Yin–Shen clash coexists</tspan></text></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>10 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="11" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S02"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-02-PERSONALITY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>核心性格与能力<small lang="en">Core Character and Capability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="61" data-source-end="115" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">不过，这一三合并未达到五行完全转化，申、辰原有的藏干与结构作用仍然保留；同时寅申冲并存，对水局成员形成修正。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="102" data-source-end="289" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The Shen–Zi–Chen Three Harmony Water configuration is established, giving unusual structural prominence to expression, production, circulation, and the conversion of thought into results.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="326" data-source-end="383" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">由此形成的性格并非单纯强硬，也不是被动柔弱，而是外在判断清楚、反应迅速，内里却需要稳定基础才能长期维持高质量输出。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="2271" data-source-end="2524" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">In ordinary life, this may appear as an ability to isolate the key issue quickly, reorganize complicated material into a coherent proposal, or translate abstract knowledge into a product, method, explanation, or decision framework that others can apply.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="177" data-source-end="269" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">庚金虽有申中同根，天干又见多个庚金比肩，显示自我标准、独立判断与同类支持并不缺席，但子月本属泄气环境，伤官及水局提高了输出强度，日主需要不断把自身力量转化为观察、判断、表达和实际成果。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="600" data-source-end="748" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">It is a layered structure in which output is concentrated, underlying support remains present, and part of the system is continually being adjusted.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>11 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="12" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S02"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>核心性格与能力<small lang="en">Core Character and Capability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D06" data-visual-grammar="CAPABILITY_CHAIN" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 590" role="img" aria-label="核心能力结构"><title>核心能力结构</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D06" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="peer" data-edge-to="output" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 101 L 360 121" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D06)"/></g><g data-edge-from="output" data-edge-to="wealth" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 212 L 360 232" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D06)"/></g><g data-edge-from="wealth" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 323 L 360 343" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D06)"/></g><g data-node-id="peer"><rect x="205" y="14" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="36" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">比肩</tspan></text><text x="360" y="57" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Peer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="output"><rect x="205" y="125" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">食神 · 伤官</tspan></text><text x="360" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Eating God · Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="199" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">壬 / 癸</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="wealth"><rect x="205" y="236" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">偏财 · 正财</tspan></text><text x="360" y="279" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Indirect · Direct Wealth</tspan></text><text x="360" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">甲 / 乙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="205" y="347" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="369" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="360" y="390" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Indirect Resource</tspan></text><text x="360" y="421" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>12 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="13" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S02"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>核心性格与能力<small lang="en">Core Character and Capability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="166" data-source-end="177" data-source-role="MECHANISM">日主旺衰定为中和偏弱。</p><p data-source-start="532" data-source-end="598" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">现实中，这类能力常表现为快速抓住问题关键，把复杂材料重新组织成清晰方案，或把抽象知识转译成别人能够采用的产品、方法、说明与判断依据。</p><p data-source-start="598" data-source-end="631" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这里所说的是结构倾向，并不等于必然具有某一种职业、学历或既定成就。</p><p data-source-start="1512" data-source-end="1561" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">因此，这一结构最成熟的状态，不是无限提高反应速度，而是在清晰判断、充分承载与现实转化之间建立节奏。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="290" data-source-end="356" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">This is not, however, a case of complete elemental transformation.</p><p data-source-start="357" data-source-end="519" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The original hidden stems and structural meanings of Shen and Chen remain active, while the Yin–Shen clash continues to modify members of the Water configuration.</p><p data-source-start="520" data-source-end="599" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The chart therefore should not be reduced to an undifferentiated mass of Water.</p><p data-source-start="750" data-source-end="806" data-source-role="MECHANISM">The Day Master is assessed as balanced but leaning weak.</p><p data-source-start="2926" data-source-end="2999" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The natural impulse is to distinguish, correct, and move matters forward.</p><p data-source-start="5991" data-source-end="6149" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">Fire in appropriate measure can represent warmth, activation, clear expectations, and a workable pace, preventing analysis from becoming too cool or detached.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>13 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="14" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S02"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>核心性格与能力<small lang="en">Core Character and Capability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="115" data-source-end="164" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">因此，命局不能只按一片水势理解，而应看作输出力量集中、内在支撑仍在、局部又持续受到牵动的复合结构。</p><p data-source-start="662" data-source-end="709" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">面对含混、低效或逻辑不一致的情况，往往较难仅以表面和谐掩盖问题，而更愿意直接辨别、修正和推进。</p><p data-source-start="778" data-source-end="811" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若合作关系具有清楚分工和相互尊重，个人判断与群体资源能够彼此增强。</p><p data-source-start="874" data-source-end="904" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">寅申冲与三合水局同时存在，为能力表现加入了一层重要的动态性。</p><p data-source-start="904" data-source-end="978" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">一方面，思路能够围绕问题迅速汇集，形成连续的分析与输出；另一方面，内部并不会完全停留在单一轨道上，而是容易出现重新校正、转换角度或推翻原方案的力量。</p><p data-source-start="1126" data-source-end="1159" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">这一命局真正需要保护的，不是表达能力本身，而是表达背后的承载能力。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="1110" data-source-end="1232" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Considerable personal energy is therefore directed into observing, evaluating, explaining, and producing tangible results.</p><p data-source-start="1490" data-source-end="1698" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The resulting character is neither simply forceful nor passive: judgment can be clear and reactions quick, while sustained high-quality performance still depends on a stable internal and practical foundation.</p><p data-source-start="1796" data-source-end="1941" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Its central capability lies not merely in possessing knowledge, but in turning understanding into something usable, exchangeable, and measurable.</p><p data-source-start="3100" data-source-end="3272" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">Companion energy does not mean competition alone; it also shows that capacity can be increased through colleagues, professional equals, and genuinely shared responsibility.</p><p data-source-start="4388" data-source-end="4447" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">Output can then move faster than assimilation and recovery.</p><p data-source-start="4565" data-source-end="4645" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Its first meaning here is the coexistence of movement and structural correction.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>14 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="15" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S03"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-03-LIFE-STRUCTURE.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>人生结构与运行方式<small lang="en">Life Structure and Operating Patterns</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="49" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">人生结构的主要运行方式，是先接收与分辨信息，再形成表达和方案，继而把输出导向资源、成果或现实安排。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="214" data-source-end="246" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">This sequence can begin quickly.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="102" data-source-end="172" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">其长处是学习与应用之间距离较短，能够一边处理材料，一边辨认其中可被改善、交换或落实的部分；但整个人生节奏也容易被“持续产生结果”的要求牵引。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="447" data-source-end="514" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">The advantage is a short distance between learning and application.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="172" data-source-end="217" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">真正决定运行质量的，不只是机会多少，而是每一轮输出之后是否有足够空间完成吸收、整理和恢复。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="213" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">The main operating sequence of this life structure is to receive and distinguish information, formulate an explanation or solution, and then direct that output toward resources, results, or practical arrangements.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>15 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="16" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S03"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>人生结构与运行方式<small lang="en">Life Structure and Operating Patterns</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure dat